Conclusion
  The AP drop-6 12-core has meas(G_C)=7/858.
  The searched coordinated replacements did not beat 7/858.
  This supports a sharper OPEN-Q-108 subtarget: prove the drop-6
  core is extremal, or prove every non-AP coordinated core has
  meas(G_C) >= 7/858.  The speed tournament is only a quotient;
  component/end-point tournaments should be tested next.
